<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-τακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set apart for a special
				use,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.69
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότακτον, τό,</span> 'speciality', <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χρεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.4.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>settled, appointed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Critias
					6.27
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <i>fixed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφόριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					42.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					280.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, etc.:—Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-τακτον</span></b> , τό, <i>fixed rent,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1124.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; <i>prescribed sum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFay.
				39
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὸν ἀ.</span> imperial
				<i>assessment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1662.14
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>set apart</i> for punishment, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				3.69
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπακτος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>in isolation,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
